    "The pending amount is an estimate based on the exchange rate from the time of payment.",
    "After the purchase settles, the card network converts the purchase using the exchange rate on the settlement day.",
    "The settlement day usually occurs one or two days after payment.",
    "The posted amount can change because of the exchange rate used on the settlement day.",
    "A foreign transaction fee may also apply based on the cardholder's plan."
